flowchart TD
    A[Source record] --> B[Map to canonical schema]
    B --> C{Required fields valid?}
    C -- No --> R[Quarantine / error log]
    C -- Yes --> D[Normalize title, body, date, source]
    D --> E[Generate content fingerprint]
    E --> F{Duplicate?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Link to canonical article]
    F -- No --> H[Store unique article]
    H --> I[Extract entities and features]
    I --> J[Assign issue cluster]
    J --> K[Predict sentiment + confidence]
    K --> L{Needs human review?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Analyst review / correction]
    L -- No --> N[Aggregate analytics]
    M --> N
    N --> O[Dashboard / report / alert]
